  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Landed `entry::helix_about`'s final half-turn on exact `z1` and clamped intermediate `lattice` depths monotonically toward `z1` ([entry.rs](crates/motion/src/entry.rs)).\n- Extracted shared depth-overlap and `CROSSING_TOUCH = 1e-9` segment-crossing checks (`z_depths_overlap`, `proper_cross_touch`, `seg_crosses_prior`, `moves_cross_prior`) in `machining2d::arc_cross` and re-exported them internally ([arc_cross.rs](crates/motion/src/machining2d/arc_cross.rs), [mod.rs](crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs)).\n- Scaled `microlift::link_at` lift heights strictly below the nearest earlier horizontal `Feed` cut plane above `z`, probed candidate links against prior `Feed` moves, promoted crossing low links to `high: true` down-only links when clear, and fell back to a `hop_z` rapid plus `Plunge` retract when even `down` crosses or the gap is `<= 0.02 mm` ([microlift.rs](crates/motion/src/machining2d/microlift.rs)).\n- Protected 3-D offset shells by probing `descent::push_helix` against posted `b.moves()` (re-placing around `along_pass`/`dive_room` or calling `fallback` when no bore clears) and hopping over any `level_ctx::feed_leg` chord that crosses a prior `Feed` move at shared depth or Z band ([descent.rs](crates/motion/src/machining3d/descent.rs), [level_ctx.rs](crates/motion/src/machining3d/level_ctx.rs)).\n- Added unit and integration pinning tests ([entry.rs](crates/motion/src/entry.rs), [microlift.rs](crates/motion/src/machining2d/microlift.rs), [pocket3d_mask_edge.rs](crates/motion/tests/pocket3d_mask_edge.rs)) and recorded the unattended design choices ([2237-pocket3d-mask-crossing.md](docs/decisions/2237-pocket3d-mask-crossing.md)).\n\n## Cause\n\n- `helix_about` snapped its last half-turn to `lattice(z1)` (`-0.45` vs `-0.44999999999999996`), leaving a 1-ULP ramp that overlapped the next level's descending helix (`min_hi - max_lo = 5.55e-17 > 0`).\n- `microlift::link_at` applied `0.30..1.50 mm` lifts without checking the stepdown gap above `z` or whether candidate microlifts crossed same-level entry ramps/helices.\n- `descent::bore_meets_lifted_leg` only checked `lvl.passes` at `pz`, missing lifted moves emitted by earlier levels into `b.moves()`.\n- `level_ctx::feed_leg` emitted shifted `OffsetRings + shell` floor passes at `bottom_z` across `x/y` already cut by the penultimate level's `floor_z`-clamped pass at exact `bottom_z`.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pins:\n  - `entry::tests::helix_about_exact_end_z_prevents_next_level_ulp_crossing` (red before fix, green after)\n  - `machining2d::microlift::tests::microlift_link_stays_below_prior_level_and_avoids_entry_crossings` (red before fix, green after)\n  - `adaptive_small_stepdown_microlift_and_helix_stay_crossing_free` in `pocket3d_mask_edge` (red before fix, green after)\n  - `offset_shell_fillet_helix_and_floor_never_cross` in `pocket3d_mask_edge` (red before fix, green after)\n- Mutations (each guard mutated individually back toward `upstream/main` -> red -> restored -> green):\n  - `entry::helix_about` exact `z1` -> `[[2, 4]]` crossing -> restored green\n  - `microlift::link_at` prior-level gap cap -> climbed to `+0.10` above `-0.15` -> restored green\n  - `microlift::link_at` `try_prof` crossing probe -> failed on `same-level ramp crossing up leg` -> restored green\n  - `level_ctx::feed_leg` `seg_crosses_prior` hop -> `[Crossing { moves: [865, 1032] }, Crossing { moves: [873, 1039] }]` -> restored green\n  - `descent::push_helix` `probe_helix`/`find_clear_helix` -> `[Crossing { moves: [224, 355] }, Crossing { moves: [725, 856] }]` -> restored green\n- Clippy: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed (`0` warnings).\n- Gate (`quick`, `--base upstream/main` at `1b6e08182`): `cargo xtask gate quick` completed `[01] motion suites` (`ok in 2822s`: all `56` `camcraft-motion` unit + integration suites passed, `0` failed) before a host restart interrupted `[02] app suites`; `[02] app suites` was then run to completion with the exact quick-gate command (`51/51` `camcraft-app` integration suites passed, `0` failed; heavy `--ignored` suites skipped as usual).\n\n## Goldens moved\n\n- None (`git diff --stat -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `~/sc-parts/sc_logo.camproj` itself (inaccessible in this worker sandbox; covered via synthetic multi-level small-stepdown Adaptive and floor-fillet `OffsetRings + shell` fixtures instead).\n- Heavy `--ignored` release suites (`adaptive_hsm`, `rotary_adaptive`, `offset_shells`, `verify` envelope tests).\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- `#2035` (Draft, `conflicts` label) touches `crates/motion/src/machining3d/descent.rs` (imports, `Ask`, `from`, `helix` -> `descent_place.rs`, `descend`), different functions from `push_helix`; whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nEffort: high\n\nChangelog: fix(3d): prevent shared-depth XY crossings in 3D pocket helices, adaptive microlifts, and offset-shell floors\n\nFixes #2237\n",
